      "post_subject": "Power/wavelength conversions",
      "content_md": "If the detector is unfiltered silicon, a good place to start would be looking at the spectral response curve of silicon, as found in the Internatinal Light handbook:\n\n[http://files.intl-light.com/handbook.pd ... etector%22](http://files.intl-light.com/handbook.pdf#search=%22spectral%20sensitivity%20curve%20silicon%20detector%22)\n\npage 48. Relative response could be made from the graph.",
